Install ironic driver deps via extras.

Ironic change I4de9cf96fd66ef3ddf3f55bb9e1850859a3fd82b removed
driver-requirements.txt, moving the two driver dependencies it
listed (ansible and networking-generic-switch) into pip extras of
the same names. Kolla has since dropped the
'-r /ironic/driver-requirements.txt' install from the
ironic-conductor image, but does not install the equivalent
extras, so the ansible and networking-generic-switch drivers are
no longer available in the image.

Install those extras from the Ironic source tree at /ironic. This
keeps the list of driver dependencies maintained in Ironic rather
than duplicating it in Kolla.

